       See  mmaatthh__eerrrroorr(7) for information on how to determine whether an error
       has occurred when calling these functions.

       The following errors can occur:

       Range error: result overflow
              _e_r_r_n_o is set to EERRAANNGGEE.  An  overflow  floating‐point  exception
              (FFEE__OOVVEERRFFLLOOWW) is raised.

       Range error: result underflow
              An underflow floating‐point exception (FFEE__UUNNDDEERRFFLLOOWW) is raised.

              These functions do not set _e_r_r_n_o for this case.

